  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solve for Tomorrow (SFT) is one of Samsung Global&#x2019;s Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) programs that aims to encourage public school students to consider how science, technology, engineering and math (STEM) can be used to find innovative solutions to challenges faced by local communities. The SFT fosters increased interest and participation in, and support for STEM through project-based learning and provides support for young people to develop skills such as problem-solving, critical thinking</narrative>
  </description>
